  "updated_at": "2026-03-27",
  "bio": "Natasha Cherry is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in floral and illustrative styles, with a talent that brings each design to life on the skin. Passionate about her craft, she operates with exceptional professionalism, ensuring every client has a comfortable and satisfying experience. Natasha is currently based in Nancy, France, and welcomes clients at renowned shops like La Fonderie Tattoo Shop in Metz and Black Diamond Toul in Toul.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Nancy, Grand Est, France"
}